  "summary_en": "This note studies the asymptotic estimation of \\(S_n=\\sum_{k=1}^n \\log k\\) using the Euler-Maclaurin formula, then determines the constant term via the Wallis product to recover Stirling's formula. It also discusses sharper remainder inequalities related to \\(\\log(n!)\\).",
