    {
      "id": "Sn-2",
      "statement_en": "Euler-Maclaurin formula: for a smooth function \\(f:[m,n]\\to\\mathbb{C}\\),\n\\[\n\\sum_{k=m}^{n}f(k)=\\int_{m}^{n}f(t)dt+\\frac{f(m)+f(n)}{2}+\\sum_{r=1}^{\\lfloor p/2\\rfloor}\\frac{B_{2r}}{(2r)!}\\left(f^{(2r-1)}(n)-f^{(2r-1)}(m)\\right)+\\frac{(-1)^{p+1}}{p!}\\int_{m}^{n}B_{p}(\\{t\\})f^{(p)}(t)dt.\n\\]",
      "statement_zh": "这个公式主要是对关于光滑函数$f:[m,n]\\to\\mathbb{C}$的离散求和的一种积分估计。$$\\sum_{k=m}^{n}f(k)=\\int_{m}^{n}f(t)dt+\\frac{f(m)+f(n)}{2}+\\sum_{r=1}^{\\lfloor p/2\\rfloor}\\frac{B_{2r}}{(2r)!}\\left(f^{(2r-1)}(n)-f^{(2r-1)}(m)\\right)+\\frac{(-1)^{p+1}}{p!}\\int_{m}^{n}B_{p}(\\{t\\})f^{(p)}(t)dt$$",
      "type": "theorem",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "domain": "real analysis",
      "key_techniques": [
        "Euler-Maclaurin summation",
        "Bernoulli polynomials"
      ],
      "prerequisites": [
        "smooth functions",
        "Bernoulli numbers",
        "repeated differentiation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Sn-3",
      "statement_en": "For \\(p\\ge 2\\), the Bernoulli polynomial remainder kernel satisfies\n\\[\n|B_p(\\{t\\})|\\le \\frac{2p!}{(2\\pi)^p}\\zeta(p).\n\\]\nIn particular, \\(|B_1(\\{t\\})|\\le 1/2\\) and \\(|B_2(\\{t\\})|\\le 1/6\\).",
      "statement_zh": "这种多项式$p\\geq2$的情况下，在$0,1]$上的估计为: $$|B_{p}(\\{t\\})|\\leq\\frac{2p!}{(2\\pi)^p}\\zeta(p)$$最常见的$B_1(x)=x-1/2,B_2(x)=x^2-x+1/6$.并且$|B_{1}(\\{t\\})|\\leq1/2,|B_{2}(\\{t\\})|\\leq1/6$.",
      "type": "lemma",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "domain": "real analysis",
      "key_techniques": [
        "Bernoulli polynomial bounds",
        "remainder estimation"
      ],
      "prerequisites": [
        "Bernoulli polynomials",
        "Riemann zeta function"
      ]
    },
