      "statement_en": "Wallis product:\n\\[\n\\frac{\\pi}{2}=\\prod_{n\\geq1}\\frac{2n}{2n-1}\\frac{2n}{2n+1}=\\lim_{n\\to+\\infty}\\frac{1}{2n+1}\\cdot\\frac{2^{4n}(n!)^4}{[(2n)!]^2}.\n\\]",
      "statement_zh": "Wallis product,1656\n>  $$\\frac{\\pi}{2}=\\prod_{n\\geq1}\\frac{2n}{2n-1}\\frac{2n}{2n+1}=\\lim_{n\\to+\\infty}\\frac{1}{2n+1}\\cdot\\frac{2^{4n}(n!)^4}{[(2n)!]^2}$$",
